WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:10.470
- When you're born, when
you were a little baby,

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.230
there's a million
yous you could be.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:24.240
A doctor, a lawyer,
a bank robber,

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:33.710
happy, sad, all different
kinds of versions of you.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:47.230
Then you start going through
life and you make this choice.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:50.880
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.832
This one.

00:00:51.832 --> 00:00:57.736
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:00:57.736 --> 00:00:59.212
[CRASH]

00:00:59.212 --> 00:01:00.196
That one.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.730
One by one, those
versions sort of go off.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:06.660
[RIPPING]

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.520
[GUN COCKING]

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.760
Like they die in a sort of way.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.840
[SCREAM]

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.667
And then finally, you
end up who you is.

00:01:29.024 --> 00:01:30.490
[DRAMATIC, DISCORDANT MUSIC]

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:35.930
- This thing that's
inside of me, it's mean.

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:39.230
- He looks like a man.

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:41.780
He is as far from
human as they come.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.130
[DRAMATIC, DISCORDANT MUSIC]

